<div class="wf-build-backdrop" id="itemBuildModal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="wf-build-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="itemBuildTitle">
        <div class="wf-build-head">
            <div class="wf-build-mark"><i class="fa-solid fa-hammer"></i></div>
            <div class="wf-build-heading">
                <div class="wf-build-kicker"><span id="ibSourceKind">GLB import</span> Final gameplay setup</div>
                <h2 id="itemBuildTitle">Item Being Built</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="wf-build-head-sub" id="ibHeadSource">Choose a source first</div>
            <button type="button" class="wf-build-x" id="ibClose" aria-label="Close item builder">✕</button>
        </div>

        <div class="wf-build-body">
            <nav class="wf-build-nav" aria-label="Item configuration sections">
                <button type="button" class="active" data-build-tab="basics" aria-label="Identity"><i class="fa-solid fa-tag"></i><span>Identity</span></button>
                <button type="button" data-build-tab="power" aria-label="Power and stats"><i class="fa-solid fa-khanda"></i><span>Power & stats</span></button>
                <button type="button" data-build-tab="effects" aria-label="Spell effects"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i><span>Spell effects</span></button>
                <button type="button" data-build-tab="rules" aria-label="Rules and value"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i><span>Rules & value</span></button>
                <button type="button" data-build-tab="review" aria-label="Review"><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check"></i><span>Review</span></button>
                <div class="wf-build-source">
                    <div class="label">Building from</div>
                    <strong id="ibNavSource">—</strong>
                    <span id="ibNavFamily">—</span>
                </div>
            </nav>

            <main class="wf-build-work">
                <div class="wf-build-errors" id="ibErrors" role="alert" aria-live="assertive" tabindex="-1"></div>

                <section class="wf-build-pane active" data-build-pane="basics">
                    <div class="wf-build-pane-title">
                        <h3>Identity & presentation</h3>
                        <p>The visual source and family are already selected. Give the resulting vanilla item its final identity.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="wf-build-card">
                        <div class="wf-build-grid">
                            <div class="wf-build-field wide">
                                <label>Item name <em>required</em></label>
                                <input type="text" id="ibName" maxlength="255" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Name this item" required>
                            </div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field">
                                <label>Source</label>
                                <input type="text" id="ibSource" readonly>
                            </div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field">
                                <label>Weapon family</label>
                                <input type="text" id="ibFamily" readonly>
                            </div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field">
                                <label>Quality <span class="wf-quality-readout" id="ibQualityReadout">Common</span></label>
                                <select id="ibQuality">
                                    <option value="0">Poor</option><option value="1" selected>Common</option>
                                    <option value="2">Uncommon</option><option value="3">Rare</option>
                                    <option value="4">Epic</option><option value="5">Legendary</option><option value="6">Artifact</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field">
                                <label>Equip slot</label>
                                <select id="ibInventoryType">
                                    <option value="13">One-Hand</option><option value="17">Two-Hand</option>
                                    <option value="21">Main Hand</option><option value="22">Off Hand</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field wide">
                                <label>Description</label>
                                <textarea id="ibDescription" maxlength="255" placeholder="Optional orange flavor text shown in-game"></textarea>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="wf-build-card" id="ibGenCard">
                        <h4>Starter settings — level, tier &amp; spec <span>Vanilla curve generator</span></h4>
                        <div class="wf-build-help" style="margin-top:0;">Pick the target level (and optionally a level-60 tier), then Generate — quality, item level, damage, speed, stats, durability, class lock and prices all land on the vanilla curve for that level. Every value stays editable in the later sections.</div>
                        <div class="wf-build-grid" style="margin-top:10px;">
                            <div class="wf-build-field"><label>Level</label><input type="number" id="ibGenLevel" min="1" max="60" step="1" value="60"></div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field"><label>Tier (level 60)</label><input type="number" id="ibGenTier" min="0" step="any" placeholder="e.g. 1.5, 3.5"></div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field"><label>Class</label><select id="ibGenClass"><option value="0">Any class (generic)</option></select></div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field"><label>Spec / role</label><select id="ibGenSpec"><option value="">Generic (balanced)</option></select></div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
                            <button type="button" class="wf-build-add" id="ibGenBtn"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> Generate starting point</button>
                            <span class="wf-build-help" id="ibGenSummary" style="margin:0;"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="wf-build-help" id="ibGenHints" style="margin-top:6px;"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="wf-build-card">
                        <h4>Level <span>Vanilla values</span></h4>
                        <div class="wf-build-grid">
                            <div class="wf-build-field">
                                <label>Item level</label>
                                <input type="number" id="ibItemLevel" min="1" max="255" step="1" value="3">
                            </div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field">
                                <label>Required character level</label>
                                <input type="number" id="ibRequiredLevel" min="0" max="60" step="1" value="1">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="wf-build-pane" data-build-pane="power">
                    <div class="wf-build-pane-title">
                        <h3>Power & direct stats</h3>
                        <p>Direct stat rows are flat vanilla points. Percentage bonuses and special combat effects belong in Spell Effects.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="wf-build-card">
                        <h4>Weapon damage <span>Primary damage row</span></h4>
                        <div class="wf-build-help" style="margin:-4px 0 10px;">The Starter settings on the Identity tab can seed damage, stats, durability and prices for a level/tier — everything here stays editable afterwards.</div>
                        <div class="wf-build-grid three">
                            <div class="wf-build-field"><label>Minimum</label><input type="number" id="ibDamageMin" min="0" step="0.1" value="2"></div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field"><label>Maximum</label><input type="number" id="ibDamageMax" min="0" step="0.1" value="4"></div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field"><label>School</label><select id="ibDamageType">
                                <option value="0">Physical</option><option value="1">Holy</option><option value="2">Fire</option>
                                <option value="3">Nature</option><option value="4">Frost</option><option value="5">Shadow</option><option value="6">Arcane</option>
                            </select></div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field">
                                <label>Swing speed (seconds)</label>
                                <input type="number" id="ibSpeed" min="0.1" max="65.535" step="0.1" placeholder="Preserve family / TBC speed">
                                <div class="wf-build-help">Leave blank to preserve the selected family or authentic TBC delay.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="wf-build-card">
                        <h4>Flat direct stats <span>Up to 10</span></h4>
                        <div class="wf-build-list" id="ibStats"></div>
                        <button type="button" class="wf-build-add" id="ibAddStat"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Add flat stat</button>
                        <div class="wf-build-help" style="margin-top:8px;">Mana, Health, Agility, Strength, Intellect, Spirit, and Stamina are the direct stat types handled by the vanilla core. “+1% hit” is an on-equip spell, not Agility or a rating conversion.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="wf-build-card">
                        <h4>Defense <span>Flat item values</span></h4>
                        <div class="wf-build-grid three">
                            <div class="wf-build-field"><label>Armor</label><input type="number" id="ibArmor" min="0" max="32767" step="1" value="0"></div>
                            <div class="wf-build-field"><label>Block value</label><input type="number" id="ibBlock" min="0" max="16777215" step="1" value="0"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="wf-build-grid three" style="margin-top:12px;">
                            <div class="wf-build-field"><label>Holy resistance</label><input type="number" id="ibHolyRes" min="0" max="32767" step="1" value="0"></div>
